  "question": {
    "text": "A water sample has ppm level concentration of following anions<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><mo>-</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msubsup><mi>SO</mi><mn>4</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mn>100</mn><mo>;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msubsup><mi>NO</mi><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mn>50</mn></math><br /><br />The anion/anions&nbsp;that make/makes&nbsp;the water sample unsuitable for drinking is/are",
    "image": null
  },
